# Store every file byte-for-byte, no line-ending conversion on any platform.
# .bat / .ps1 / .ahk must stay CRLF (Japanese cmd misparses for/if blocks and ^
# continuation lines when they are LF); .properties / .md stay LF. Without this,
# Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) committed the .bat files as LF, and GitHub's
# "Download ZIP" handed out broken scripts (found 2026-10-12; SHA256SUMS.txt
# catches it). git archive / Download ZIP honour this attribute.
* -text
